        [
          "licensing",
          "fee plus royalty per unit",
          "royalty per unit shipped",
          "dependence on the partner"
        ]
      ],
      "highlight": 1,
      "note": "The model fixes the metric you optimise: a marketplace cannot be steered by MRR, and SaaS cannot be steered by GMV."
